flowchart TD
    Start([开始]) --> Delay[vTaskDelayUntil 10ms]
    Delay --> ReadYaw[MPU6050_DMP_GetYaw]
    ReadYaw --> CheckMode{g_closed_loop?}
    CheckMode -- 是 --> CalcPID[PID_Calculate target - yaw]
    CalcPID --> MapPWM[SG90_MapClosedLoopPid 死区映射]
    MapPWM --> SetPWM[SG90_SetPulseUs]
    SetPWM --> LoopBack[循环]
    CheckMode -- 否 --> OpenLoop[直接输出 g_pid_output]
    OpenLoop --> SetPWM
    LoopBack --> Delay

    style CalcPID fill:#ffebee,stroke:#b71c1c
    style MapPWM fill:#e8f5e9,stroke:#1b5e20
    style CheckMode fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#e65100
